{
  "id": "05",
  "title": "中介軟體矩陣",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12) 0%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #A855F7; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A855F7\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon 的 <strong>中介軟體矩陣 (Middleware Matrix)</strong> 是一個專為「洋蔥模型」設計的零延遲攔截管道，以微秒級的開銷編排請求流。</p></div><h2>洋蔥協定 (The Onion Protocol)</h2><p>Photon 中的中介軟體不僅僅是一個列表，它是一個遞迴執行的堆疊。每一層都具備對上游請求與下游回應的完全控制權，實現了強大的雙向轉換能力。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(168,85,247,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 0 1 10 10\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">異步鏈結</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">針對 JIT 異步迭代進行優化。所有的執行鏈在啟動階段都會被編譯為扁平化的執行陣列。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(168,85,247,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18\"/><path d=\"M9 21V9\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">上下文流</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">利用 Scoped Context 在不同層級間傳遞數據，避免全域污染或昂貴的物件克隆開銷。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(168,85,247,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">智能閘門</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">與路徑路由高度整合。系統僅會針對特定的請求模式分發相關的中介軟體。</p></div></div><h2>實作模式</h2><p>中介軟體的註冊是聲明式的。從日誌記錄到高頻二進位轉換，執行的先後順序定義了矩陣的拓撲結構。</p><pre><code>app.use(async (c, next) => {\n  // 1. 前置階段 (傳入請求)\n  const telemetryId = crypto.randomUUID()\n  \n  await next()\n  \n  // 2. 後置階段 (傳出回應)\n  c.header('X-Trace-Id', telemetryId)\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #A855F7; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #A855F7; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 協定建議：中斷機制 (Halting)</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">如果您在呼叫 <code>await next()</code> <strong>之前</strong> 返回了回應，整個管道將立即停止。這是在執行身份驗證與流量限制時的最佳策略。</p></div><h2>調度延遲分析</h2><p>中介軟體層級的執行開銷分析。Photon 即使在 50 層以上的嵌套堆疊中仍能保持線性的效能表現。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_PIPELINE_DISPATCH (每層)</span> <span>0.008μs</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(168,85,247,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 5%; background: #A855F7; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(168,85,247,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>遞迴 Promise 開銷 (常規框架)</span> <span>0.42μs</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 90%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 延遲降低：調度速度較常規模式快約 50 倍</p></div><h2>核心整合</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">二進位協定</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 12px;\">透過內容協商將 JSON 即時轉換為 CBOR。</p><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>import { binaryMiddleware } from '@gravito/photon'\n\napp.use(binaryMiddleware())</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">HTMX 引擎</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 12px;\">自動檢測 HX 標頭並填充上下文狀態。</p><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>import { htmxMiddleware } from '@gravito/photon'\n\napp.use(htmxMiddleware())</code></pre></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #EAB308; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>開發者洞察：</strong> 在 <code>await next()</code> 之後執行的中介軟體可以取得最終的回應狀態與標頭。這是實作「審計日誌 (Audit Logging)」或「回應壓縮」的最佳位置。</p></div>",
